        "brief": "Script must run, but not be world-writable."
      },
      "buggyCode": "# deploy.sh must run\nchmod 777 deploy.sh\n./deploy.sh",
      "prompt": "Main risk?",
      "options": [
        "777 = everyone can write → trojan deploy script",
